{"code":"vi-VN","name":"Vietnamese","native":"Tiếng Việt","badge":"VI","tts":"vi-VN","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Tôi không hiểu.","say":"toy khohm hyew","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Tôi không biết.","say":"toy khohm byet","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Chờ một chút nhé.","say":"chuh moht choot nyeh","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Bạn nói lại được không?","say":"bahn noy lai duh-uhk khohm","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Làm ơn nói chậm lại.","say":"lahm uhn noy chuhm lai","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"“…” tiếng Việt nói thế nào?","say":"… tyeng vyet noy teh now","en":"How do you say “…” in Vietnamese?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Tất nhiên.","say":"tuht nyen","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Đúng rồi.","say":"doong zoy","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Tôi nghĩ vậy.","say":"toy ngee vay","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Thật không?","say":"tuht khohm","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Không sao.","say":"khohm sao","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Tuyệt quá!","say":"twyet kwah","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x} ở đâu?","say":"{x} uh dow","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Cho tôi {x}.","say":"chaw toy {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"],"lit":"give me {x}"},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Có {x} không?","say":"gaw {x} khohm","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"Làm ơn cho {x}.","say":"lahm uhn chaw {x}","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Tôi phải {x}.","say":"toy fai {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Tôi {x} được không?","say":"toy {x} duh-uhk khohm","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Để tôi kiểm tra.","say":"deh toy kyem chah","en":"Let me check.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Tôi có cuộc họp.","say":"toy gaw kwohk hop","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Có cay không?","say":"gaw kai khohm","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Không hành nhé.","say":"khohm hahn nyeh","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Món nào ngon?","say":"mon now ngon","en":"Which dish is good?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Tôi không ăn thịt.","say":"toy khohm an tit","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"},{"id":"x.T11","t":"Tính tiền!","say":"tin tyen","en":"Check, please! (the usual way to ask)"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Bao nhiêu tiền?","say":"bao nyew tyen","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Tôi chỉ xem thôi.","say":"toy chee sem toy","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Tôi lấy cái này.","say":"toy lay gai nay","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Trả bằng thẻ được không?","say":"chah bang teh duh-uhk khohm","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Có xa không?","say":"gaw sah khohm","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Cho tôi ra sân bay.","say":"chaw toy zah suhn bai","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"trái · phải · thẳng","say":"chai · fai · tang","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Cứu tôi với!","say":"kew toy vuh-ee","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Không có giấy vệ sinh.","say":"khohm gaw zay veh sin","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Tôi thấy không khỏe.","say":"toy tay khohm kwheh","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Làm ơn gọi xe cấp cứu.","say":"lahm uhn goy seh guhp kew","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Rất vui được gặp bạn.","say":"zuht vooy duh-uhk gap bahn","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Bạn đến từ đâu?","say":"bahn den tuh dow","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Bạn làm nghề gì?","say":"bahn lahm ngeh zee","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Ngon quá!","say":"ngon kwah","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Xin chào.","say":"sin chow","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Chào buổi sáng.","say":"chow bwoy sahng","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Bạn khỏe không?","say":"bahn kwheh khohm","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Vâng. · Không.","say":"vuhng · khohm","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Làm ơn.","say":"lahm uhn","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Cảm ơn.","say":"gahm uhn","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Xin lỗi.","say":"sin loy","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Tạm biệt.","say":"tahm byet","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"một · hai · ba","say":"moht · hai · bah","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"bốn · năm · sáu","say":"bohn · nam · sow","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"bảy · tám · chín","say":"bai · tahm · chin","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"mười · hai mươi · một trăm","say":"muh-ee · hai muh-ee · moht chahm","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Quả táo màu đỏ.","say":"kwah tow mow daw","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” before adjectives · words never change form"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Tôi ăn quả táo.","say":"toy an kwah tow","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"same order as English"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Tôi đã ăn quả táo.","say":"toy dah an kwah tow","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"đã before the verb = past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Tôi muốn ăn quả táo.","say":"toy mwohn an kwah tow","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"muốn + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Bạn có ăn táo không?","say":"bahn gaw an tow khohm","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"có … không wraps a yes/no question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"nhà vệ sinh","say":"nyah veh sin","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"nhà thuốc","say":"nyah twohk","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"bệnh viện","say":"ben vyen","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"nhà ga","say":"nyah gah","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"sân bay","say":"suhn bai","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"khách sạn","say":"khahk sahn","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"nước","say":"nuh-uhk","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"một ly cà phê","say":"moht lee gah feh","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"hóa đơn","say":"hwah duhn","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"thực đơn","say":"tuhk duhn","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"một chai bia","say":"moht chai bee-ah","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"cái này","say":"gai nay","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"túi","say":"tooy","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"cuộc họp","say":"kwohk hop","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"tệp","say":"tep","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"màn hình","say":"mahn hin","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"tin nhắn","say":"tin nyan","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"ngày mai","say":"ngai mai","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"đi","say":"dee","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"vào","say":"vow","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"trả tiền","say":"chah tyen","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Dị ứng · xin vui lòng đọc","ask":"Món này có những thứ này không?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Cảm ơn nhiều!","note":"Peanut is đậu phộng in the south, lạc in the north. Fish sauce (nước mắm) is in almost everything.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Tôi bị dị ứng đậu phộng nặng. Tôi không thể ăn đậu phộng hay dầu đậu phộng.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Tôi bị dị ứng hải sản có vỏ (tôm, cua, sò).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Tôi không thể ăn gluten (lúa mì).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Tôi ăn chay. Tôi không ăn thịt, gà hay cá. Không nước mắm.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Tôi không ăn thịt heo.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"NHÀ VỆ SINH · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"NAM · NỮ","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"LỐI RA · LỐI VÀO","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ĐẨY · KÉO","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"LỐI THOÁT HIỂM","en":"Emergency exit"}]}